/F4 11 Tf 0 687 Td 0.000 Tc(potential energy is a measure of how much physical resistance the sequence would put up if forced to be)Tj
0 -13.2 Td(folded into the desired structure\227the lower the potential energy, the higher the fitness. Of course one would)Tj
0 -13.2 Td(not want to physically force every sequence in the population into the desired structure and measure its)Tj
0 -13.2 Td(resistance\227this would be very difficult, if not impossible. Instead, given a sequence and a desired structure)Tj
0 -13.2 Td(\(and knowing some of the relevant biophysics\), one can estimate the potential energy by calculating some of)Tj
0 -13.2 Td(the forces acting on each amino acid, so the whole fitness calculation can be done computationally.)Tj
