0 -13.2 Td(Having the desired behavior encoded genetically would give an organism a selective advantage over)Tj
0 -13.2 Td(organisms that were merely able to learn the desired behavior during their lifetimes, because learning a)Tj
0 -13.2 Td(behavior is generally a less reliable process than developing a genetically encoded behavior; too many)Tj
