/F4 11 Tf 0 -40.568 Td(One cannot help but be struck by certain seemingly "aesthetic" traits of organisms, such as the elaborate)Tj
0 -13.2 Td(plumage of peacocks and the massive antlers of some deer. Those with some knowledge of evolution might)Tj
0 -13.2 Td(also be struck by two strange facts: at least in mammals, it is usually the male of the species that has such)Tj
