0 -13.2 Td(male and vice versa to produce two offspring. The two offspring were then mutated with the very small)Tj
0 -13.2 Td(probability of 0.00001 per gene.)Tj
0 -26.4 Td(This simulation relaxes some of the simplifying assumptions of Kirkpatrick's analytic model: the population is)Tj
