/F4 11 Tf 0 -27.368 Td(As genetic algorithms become more widely used for practical problem solving and for scientific modeling,)Tj
0 -13.2 Td(increasing emphasis is placed on understanding their theoretical foundations. Some major questions in this)Tj
0 -13.2 Td(area are the following:)Tj
0 -26.4 Td(What laws describe the macroscopic behavior of GAs? In particular, what predictions can be made about the)Tj
