0 -26.4 Td(How do the low-level operators \(selection, crossover, mutation\) give rise to the macroscopic behavior of)Tj
0 -13.2 Td(GAs?)Tj
0 -26.4 Td(On what types of problems are GAs likely to perform well?)Tj
0 -26.4 Td(On what types of problems are GAs likely to perform poorly?)Tj
