0 -13.2 Td(functions of interest, it is difficult if not impossible to compute the "fitness" of a partial string. Many loci)Tj
0 -13.2 Td(typically interact non-independently to determine a string's fitness, and in an underspecified string the)Tj
0 -13.2 Td(missing loci might be crucial. Goldberg and his colleagues first proposed and then rejected an "averaging")Tj
0 -13.2 Td(method: for agiven underspecified string, randomly generate values for the missing loci over a number of)Tj
0 -13.2 Td(trials and take the average fitness computed with these random samples. The idea is to estimate the average)Tj
0 -13.2 Td(fitness of the candidate schema. But, as was pointed out earlier, the variance of this average fitness will often)Tj
0 -13.2 Td(be too high for a meaningful average to be gained from such sampling. Instead, Goldberg and his colleagues)Tj
0 -13.2 Td(used a method they called "competitive templates." The idea was not to estimate the average fitness of the)Tj
0 -13.2 Td(candidate schema but to see if the candidate schema yields an improvement over a local optimum. The)Tj
0 -13.2 Td(method works by finding a local optimum at the beginning of a run by a hill-climbing technique, and then,)Tj
0 -13.2 Td(when running the messy GA, evaluating underspecified strings by filling in missing bits from the local)Tj
0 -13.2 Td(optimum and then applying the fitness function. A local optimum is, by definition, a string that cannot be)Tj
0 -13.2 Td(improved by a single-bit change; thus, if a candidate schema's defined bits improve the local optimum, it is)Tj
0 -13.2 Td(worth further exploration.)Tj
0 -26.4 Td(The messy GA proceeds in two phases: the "primordial phase" and the "juxtapositional phase." The purpose)Tj
0 -13.2 Td(of the primordial phase is to enrich the population with small, promising candidate schemas, and the purpose)Tj
0 -13.2 Td(of the juxtapositional phase is to put them together in useful ways. Goldberg and his colleagues' first method)Tj
0 -13.2 Td(was to guess at the order)Tj
/F6 11 Tf ( k)Tj
/F4 11 Tf ( of the smallest relevant schemas and to form the initial population by completely)Tj
