0 -205.753 Td(After the initial population has been formed and the initial fitnesses evaluated \(using competitive templates\),)Tj
0 -13.2 Td(the primordial phase continues by selection only \(making copies of strings in proportion to their fitnesses with)Tj
0 -13.2 Td(no crossover or mutation\) and by culling the population by half at)Tj
( regular intervals. At some generation \(a)Tj
0 -13.2 Td(parameter of the algorithm\), the primordial phase comes to an end and the juxtapositional phase is invoked.)Tj
